OL,3,GNEWSAFormer UUP councillor Linzi
OL,4,AMcLaren to run as SDLP Stormont
OL,5,Acandidate
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former Ulster Unionist Party (UUP)
OL,8,Fcouncillor has been selected to run as
OL,9,Fan SDLP candidate in the Stormont
OL,10,Fassembly election next May.
OL,12,FLinzi McLaren, who left the UUP in
OL,13,FOctober 2025, is set to contest South
OL,14,FAntrim.
OL,16,FIn a statement, the former police
OL,17,Fofficer said her "values have not
OL,18,Fchanged but my perspective has".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
