OL,3,GNEWSAFormer UUP councillor Linzi
OL,4,AMcLaren to run as SDLP Stormont
OL,5,Acandidate
OL,6,
OL,7,FSDLP leader Claire Hanna said that
OL,8,Fbuilding a new Ireland "means reaching
OL,9,Fbeyond traditional political
OL,10,Fidentities, listening to people whose
OL,11,Fexperiences are different from our
OL,12,Fown".
